{
 "_about": "The token tree build_tokens.py turns into tokens.json. artboard.studio is a Webflow + Relume marketing site: the --color-scheme-1..10 slot vars (text/background/foreground/border/accent, the ink #0d1400), the --mg-* editor palette (mg-gree #aaff00 brand green), the generic font stacks and a handful of palette hexes. The light set holds the site's roles; measured values that no variable declares (radii, control heights) come from raw/components-computed.json. \"var\" leaves resolve through the live document; \"value\" leaves are measured.",
